---
description: Rules for the Expo mobile app
globs: apps/mobile/**,packages/ui-native/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- Expo Router and NativeWind on `packages/ui` tokens. RTL through `I18nManager` (restart flow).
- Tokens in `expo-secure-store` only. The offline event pack is encrypted at rest and wiped 48h after the event.
- The QR scanner must work fully offline. Queue scans with a client UUID.
